<title>NETHERLANDS: HOLLAND COLOURS 1996/97 NET UP.</title>
<headline>HOLLAND COLOURS 1996/97 NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.65 vs   5.22</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.55 vs   4.32</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.50 vs   2.14</p>
<p>    Turnover				91.0  vs  76.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    11.0  vs   8.5</p>
<p>    Cash flow			     37.1  vs  30.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Ink and pigments maker Holland Colours NV said its</p>
<p>1996/97 dividend can be taken up in cash or in new shares.</p>
<p>Details of the stock dividend will be announced on June 20.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
